//! Generated by `make charts` - do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Read out of GTO Wizard solution screenshots by `make charts`, which needs
//! the images and the reader in `scripts/charts`; neither is in the repository,
//! and this file is what the build actually reads. Weights are in per mille, so a
//! hand the solver raises a third of the time arrives at 333.
//!
//! `zero_ev` names the hands the chart plays at no gain: the solver is
//! indifferent between them and folding, and a reader can ask for the
//! chart without them.

